OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy this
OL,6,Fevening with showery rain dying out
OL,7,Flater. Then the rest of the night will
OL,8,Fsee some clear spells along with a few
OL,9,Fshowers, mainly in the west.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FIt will be a bright day with
OL,12,Fsome sunny spells. There will also be
OL,13,Fa few showers, turning heavier in the
OL,14,Fafternoon. Strong to gale southwest
OL,15,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
