OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FFrequent showers on Tuesday with
OL,7,Fstrong to gale westerly winds. Showers
OL,8,Fdying out on Wednesday with some sunny
OL,9,Fspells developing. Rain spreading from
OL,10,Fthe west on Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
